ranscript.aspx"},{"c":"ARCC 2020 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mitch Goldstein","x":"We have also found compelling fee opportunities in today's market as our senior loan restructuring fees in the third quarter were nearly 20% higher than the fees on senior loans from the first quarter of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2020 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Penni Roll","x":"I would just remind everyone too, that when we exit or have some kind of restructuring event, we often also -- or we do need to look at anything that we exchange at fair value so that we would be able to we would have to record the loss, but then we have the new basis effectively and anything…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2020 Q4","e":"arcc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Hecht","x":"Or was some of that related to some restructuring activities?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/ares-capital-arcc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2021 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kipp DeVeer","x":"I think we had a special dividend from one company in particular that we've been restructuring that we now own.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2021 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2021-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kipp DeVeer","x":"For the most part, our companies are underwritten to really try to waive those and that have good pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2021 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2021-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kipp DeVeer","x":"We have very little exposure to industries and to companies where there's no pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2021 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2021-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mitch Goldstein","x":"As Kipp mentioned, this type of outcome is not unique as we have generated over $380 million of restructuring gains since our IPO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q2","e":"arcc","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"We are pleased with our profitability and the continued strength of our portfolio, particularly in light of the tariff-related volatility that led to economic uncertainty and reduced investment activity during the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/ares-capital-arcc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q2","e":"arcc","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"We also take comfort in the fact that our portfolio is focused on domestic, service-oriented businesses that, in our view, carry lower policy risk from tariffs and other recently proposed and implemented government policies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/ares-capital-arcc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q2","e":"arcc","d":"2025-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"…a lot of time through the quarter speaking to all of our impacted portfolio companies, understanding their ability to mitigate the tariffs, the pricing actions or moving manufacturing or other measures and I think our portfolio companies feel quite good about being able to pass through pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/ares-capital-arcc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q2","e":"arcc","d":"2025-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"But I think what we found is that our companies have reached out to their customers and had discussions about pending price increases and are feeling relatively good about the responses they're getting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/ares-capital-arcc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2025-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"Let me make a few comments on how we have carefully constructed our software portfolio over two decades of investing in this sector and why we believe AI is much more of an opportunity than a risk for our software borrowers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2025-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"Importantly, these views reflect Ares' ongoing collaboration among our highly experienced software investment team, our in-house software analysts, and Ares' in-house AI experts at Bootstrap Labs, a leading AI-focused venture capital investment team that joined the Ares platform a few years ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2025-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"New issue transaction volumes are returning to a more normalized pace driven by greater clarity on tariffs, and the direction of short-term interest rates, and narrowing bid-ask spreads on buyouts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2025-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"We also take comfort in our portfolio's focus on domestic, service-oriented businesses, which mitigates risks associated with tariffs, shifts in government spending, and other recent policy changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"With the restructuring of Potomac's balance sheet, the incremental capital we invested, our proactive management of the company, and patience, we were able to achieve an IRR of approximately 15% on our investment rather than incurring a loss.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2025-10-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"…these companies are deeply embedded within customer operations and also benefit from high switching costs given the risk of business disruption from moving to alternative vendors, which, in our view, provides additional layers of durability and resilience against potential AI disruption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q4","e":"arcc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jim Miller","x":"So John, you think about like Jefferies is not going to rip out its core infrastructure software and replace it with an AI-based solution anytime soon in our opinion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/ares-capital-arcc-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q4","e":"arcc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jim Miller","x":"It's been investing in AI for more than a decade And we use all of these resources to help us evaluate every new deal we do as well as during our quarterly evaluation process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/ares-capital-arcc-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q4","e":"arcc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"During 2025, we realized over $470 million of gross gains from our equity co-investment portfolio and our successful portfolio management and restructuring efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/ares-capital-arcc-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2025 Q4","e":"arcc","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jim Miller","x":"And obviously AI is probably the most disruptive technology risk that we could have imagined.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/ares-capital-arcc-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"Most of these companies are also protected by business models with strong contractual cash flows and continue to sign up new customer contracts as they move forward and invest in AI themselves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Arren Saul Cyganovich","x":"Should we expect kind of a similar slowdown that we saw last year due to the tariff stuff we saw in the second quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"Obviously, you mentioned last year, kind of similar things — it really slowed down with the tariff noise and then the second half was extremely busy and we posted record volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2026-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"We have an over 50-person portfolio management and restructuring team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2026-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"I would say on Pluralsight, the way that deal resolved itself — the sponsor worked consensually with us to effectuate a restructuring and hand over the keys to the lender group.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"As I articulated on our last earnings call, not all software companies carry the same level of AI disruption, and in fact, many are embracing AI and seeing enhanced growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q1","e":"arcc","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Kort Schnabel","x":"When you analyzed sensitivity or exposure to AI disruption, did that include an assessment of potential revenue model shifts for the software companies?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/ares-capital-arcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARCC 2026 Q3","e":"arcc","d":"2026-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Johnson","x":"During the quarter, I guess, speaking a little bit more broadly to the portfolio company itself, but I was curious of your thoughts on the recent restructuring or sorry, should call it, recapitalization of Symplr Software with the preferred capital being raised there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/27/ares-capital-arcc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,9178,0,0,0,3790,4783],[37,1,6602,0,0,0,5314,845],[38,1,7171,0,0,0,5066,1603],[39,1,8070,0,0,0,2160,5345],[40,1,6244,0,0,0,3231,2582],[41,1,8321,0,0,0,